    - target: {fileID: 5402411782391686167, guid: c794586a7f1f0f7439184f85304b4539, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'firstInteraction.Array.data[0]'
      value: " L\xE0 o\xF9 la racine enlace la pierre... C\u2019est l\xE0 que le
        chemin commence."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5402411782391686167, guid: c794586a7f1f0f7439184f85304b4539, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'firstInteraction.Array.data[1]'
      value: "Le vent conna\xEEt la route, m\xEAme quand les yeux la voient pas."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5402411782391686167, guid: c794586a7f1f0f7439184f85304b4539, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'firstInteraction.Array.data[2]'
      value: " Si tu cherches ton chemin, suis-le. Il guide ceux qui savent \xE9couter."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5402411782391686167, guid: c794586a7f1f0f7439184f85304b4539, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'firstInteraction.Array.data[3]'
      value: "Marche, enfant du doute. Tes pas finiront par te montrer la v\xE9rit\xE9."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5402411782391686167, guid: c794586a7f1f0f7439184f85304b4539, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'firstInteraction.Array.data[4]'
      value: "Marche, enfant du doute. Tes pas finiront par te montrer la v\xE9rit\xE9."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5402411782391686167, guid: c794586a7f1f0f7439184f85304b4539, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'repeatInteraction.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Oooommm\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5402411782391686167, guid: c794586a7f1f0f7439184f85304b4539, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'repeatInteraction.Array.data[1]'
      value: " La nuit est \xE9ternelle maintenant\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5402411782391686167, guid: c794586a7f1f0f7439184f85304b4539, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'repeatInteraction.Array.data[2]'
      value: " La nuit est longue, mais elle parle \xE0 ceux qui tendent l\u2019oreille..."
